OL,3,GNEWSAHow a city's food waste heats
OL,4,Ahomes and businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost three thousand tonnes of food
OL,7,Fwaste has been gathered from doorsteps
OL,8,Fin Derby since the start of a new
OL,9,Fscheme in April.
OL,11,FThe government has told councils they
OL,12,Fmust offer a waste food collection
OL,13,Fservice to homes, with the waste
OL,14,Fcollected used to create biogas and
OL,15,Ffertiliser.
OL,17,FFood waste is transported to Severn
OL,18,FTrent Green Power's plant at Spondon in
OL,19,FDerby. There it is shredded and has
OL,20,Fplastic packaging removed before being
OL,21,Fmixed with water and pumped to one of
OL,22,Fthe site's five anaerobic digesters.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
