OL,3,GNEWSAHow a city's food waste heats
OL,4,Ahomes and businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe process removes the need for waste
OL,7,Fto be incinerated or sent to landfill
OL,8,Fas well as providing gas for homes and
OL,9,Fbusinesses.
